 "title": "Adic transport of trace and coherence",
 "statement": "In the situation of [thm-pur-adic-reconstruction], the same\ntransport statement holds for the smooth trace of\n[def-pur-smooth-trace] and for the coherence statements of\n[thm-pur-composition-coherence] and\n[thm-pur-smooth-base-change-coherence].",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-smooth-purity/sk-thm-purity-transport/prop-pur-adic-reconstruction-trace-coherence.md",
  "place": "node prop-pur-adic-reconstruction-trace-coherence, order 2024"
