 ],
 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "The trace of [def-pur-smooth-trace] is the counit of the realized\nadjunction and its transport is\nincluded in the same reconstruction\n([lem-weil-pbc-reconstruction-uniform-tower]), as in the trace-formula\nblueprint; the coherence statements are the compatible systems of the\nfinite-level coherence statements of\n[thm-pur-composition-coherence] and\n[thm-pur-smooth-base-change-coherence].",
